WHY THIS LICENSE
----------------
1,019 of the reference riddles in `data/reference-slice.jsonl` are derived
from CC-Riddle, which its authors released under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. We
redistribute a selected slice of that corpus, reorganized by target
character and augmented with explanations — i.e. Adapted Material. The
ShareAlike condition therefore applies to the data package.

Our own original contributions (the 600 model-authored riddles, the
experimental records, the analyses) are not themselves derivative of
CC-Riddle. They are bundled here under the same CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 terms so that
the package has a single, unambiguous license, rather than requiring users to
make a per-record legal determination.

